{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんGW何して過ごしてますか？(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰省したりする人も多いのかなぁ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全然関係ないですが、\n私のお母さんが昔の写真に写る格好や髪型と\nお笑い芸人の平野ノラさんの姿が\nほぼ同じでびっくりしています笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のNOGIBINGO!6で\n未央奈とカップルになりました～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2016/05/03/8394144/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかこの2人だけ雰囲気が\n違いましたが...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2016/05/03/8394144/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"両手に花♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あまりにみんなの男装が\n似合っててかっこよかったので\n私が男装したらどんな感じに\nなるんだろう？と思ったけど\nなんだか似合わなそうな\n気がしますヾ(-ω-*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しいことに、\n1回戦で負けてしまったので..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2016/05/03/8394144/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エアビリヤードをしてました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回予告で私吹っ飛んでましたが\nそちらもお楽しみに～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日明後日は京都で握手会です♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"GWいっぱいみなさんに\n会える～\\( ^^)/♡\\(^^ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなったんのパワーも\nどんどん溜まります(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんもまなったん不足\n解消してますか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば乃木恋のCMをよく見るっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はお弁当のミニトマトを\nアーン♡ってしてるよー∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"CM撮影のときに一緒にした\n動画の撮影で胸キュン台詞みたいなのを\n1人ずつ撮ったんだけど、監督さんに\n「自分の好きな台詞を考えて\n言ってください」と言われたので\n自分なりに台詞を言ってみたら\n「すみません、とてもいいんですけど\nちょっと長いです...」って言われて\nすごく恥ずかしくなりました笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"張り切り過ぎたみたいです(´°ω°｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話が逸れましたが\n握手レーンは前回同様、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握は第5レーン\n個握は第3レーン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でございます(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握は何着よっかな？\nノギルーム#1で着てたパジャマを\n着ようか迷い中(人-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも握手会のとき、\n朝はいつもすごく寒いので\nどうしよっかなぁとも\n思っております。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうちょい迷っとこう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木中で言ってたうさちゃんリップ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2016/05/03/8394144/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分でやろうとしたら\nこうなっちゃった(｡･ω･)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか難しい～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"首にホクロあるんだよ～♪\n知ってた？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けどこのホクロ小学生の時\n急に取れたの(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝起きたら無くなってたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも気づいたらまたついてたヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーっ\n何の話してるんでしょうか笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁいっか♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今すごく旅行に行きたいです(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温泉と旅館の美味しいご飯で\nのーんびりしたい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2連休できたら行こっかな(。-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2016/05/03/8394144/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木恋の衣装(｡･v･)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書きたい事をつらつら書いたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まとまりがない記事に\nなってしまいましたが\n明日京都で待ってます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでやす～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみです～♡"}],"source":"archive"}